# title: Locally capped cliquet
# category: Cliquets
# underlyings: 1
# source: Wilmott, Cliquet Options and Volatility Models, Wilmott Magazine, 2002
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: Adds up four quarterly returns, each floored and capped: a guaranteed-positive, capped exposure to steady growth.
# param: notional = 1000 | amount | Notional
# param: local_floor = 0.0 | percent | Floor on each quarterly return
# param: local_cap = 0.03 | percent | Cap on each quarterly return
#
# Each quarter's return is measured from the previous quarter's close.

2027-01-04
    notional = 1000
    local_floor = 0.0
    local_cap = 0.03
    ref = spot()
    total = 0

2027-04-05  2027-07-06  2027-10-04
    total = total + min(max(spot() / ref - 1, local_floor), local_cap)
    ref = spot()

2028-01-04
    total = total + min(max(spot() / ref - 1, local_floor), local_cap)
    pays notional * total
